    S:gt.blockmachines.algaefarm.controller.tier.single.tooltip=Machine Type: §eAlgae Pond§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\nGrows Algae!\nProvide compost to boost production by one tier\nDoes not require power or maintenance\nAll Machine Casings must be the same tier, this dictates machine speed\nFill Input Hatch with Water to fill the inside of the multiblock\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.algaefarm.controller.tier.single.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §69§7x§69§7x§63§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §675+ §fMachine Casing §b(Tiered)\n   §664 §fSterile Farm Casing\n§f   Input Bus: §7Any Casing\n§f   Output Bus: §7Any Casing\n§f   Input Hatch: §7Any Casing\nSubchannel §bcasing§7 determines §bMachine Casing Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.amazonprime.controller.tier.single.tooltip=Machine Type: §ePackager, Unpackager, AWD§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\nThis Multiblock is used for EXTREME packaging requirements\n§616§7 Parallels per §fVoltage§7 Tier\n§a600%§7 Speed\n§b75%§7 EU Usage\nCan be configured with a screwdriver to work as an Unpackager\nDust Schematics are inserted into the input buses\nIf inserted into the controller, it is shared across all buses\n1x, 2x, 3x & Other Schematics are to be placed into the controller GUI slot\n§7§540§7 Pollution per second\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.amazonprime.controller.tier.single.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §63§7x§63§7x§63§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center\n   §610+ §fSupply Depot Casing\n§f   Input Bus: §7Any Casing\n§f   Output Bus: §7Any Casing\n§f   Energy Hatch: §7Any Casing\n§f   Maintenance Hatch: §7Any Casing\n§f   Muffler Hatch: §7Any Casing\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
