    S:gt.blockmachines.treefarm.controller.tier.single.tooltip=Machine Type: §eTree Farm, TGS§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\nFarms and harvests trees using EU\nPlace a sapling in the controller slot\nPlace a tool in an input bus\nDifferent tools are required for different outputs\nAdvanced tools multiply output amount\n  Logs: Saw (1x), Buzzsaw (2x), Chainsaw (4x)\n  Saplings: Branch Cutter (1x), Grafter (4x)\n  Leaves: Shears (1x), Wire Cutter (2x), Electric Wire Cutter (4x)\n  Fruit: Knife (1x)\nMultiple tools can be used at the same time\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nWork time is fixed at 5 seconds\nEnergy Input Tier multiplies output further\nOutput multiplier is equal to: 2*tier^2 - 2*tier + 5\n§7§5100§7 Pollution per second\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.treefarm.controller.tier.single.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §63§7x§63§7x§63§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center\n   §68+ §fSterile Farm Casing\n§f   Input Bus: §7Any Casing\n   §eStocking Input Buses and Crafting Input Buses/Buffers are not allowed!\n§f   Output Bus: §7Any Casing\n§f   Energy Hatch: §7Any Casing\n§f   Maintenance Hatch: §7Any Casing\n§f   Muffler Hatch: §7Any Casing\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.universalchemicalfuelengine.tooltip=Machine Type: §eChemical Engine, UCFE§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\nBURNING BURNING BURNING\nUse combustible liquid to generate power\nYou need to supply Combustion Promoter to keep it running\nIt will consume all the fuel and combustion promoter in the hatch every second\nEnergy output to the dynamo will be distributed over the next second\nIf the Dynamo Hatch's buffer fills up, the machine will stop\nIf the amount of energy to be produced is higher than the dynamo hatch can handle then all produced energy will void\nWhen turned on, there is a 10-second period where the machine will not stop\nEven if it doesn't stop, all the fuel in the hatch will be consumed\nThe efficiency is determined by the proportion of Combustion Promoter to fuel\nThe higher the amount of promoter, the higher the efficiency\nFollows an exponential curve exp(-C/(p/x))*1.5, where x is the amount of fuel in liters, p is the amount of promoter in liters\nand C depends on the fuel type. Diesel: C=0.04; Gas: C=0.04; Rocket fuel: C=0.005\nIt creates sqrt(Current Output Power) pollution every second\nIf you forget to supply Combustion Promoter, this engine will swallow all the fuel §ewithout outputting energy\nThe efficiency is up to 150%\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.universalchemicalfuelengine.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §69§7x§65§7x§64§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center, 2nd layer\n   §693 §fStable Titanium Machine Casing\n   §614 §fTitanium Gear Box Casing\n   §614 §fEngine Intake Casing\n   §614 §fTitanium Plated Cylinder\n   §614 §fTitanium Pipe Casing\n   §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Hint block number 1\n   §fMuffler Hatch: §7Hint block number 2 (fill all slots with mufflers)\n   §fInput Hatch: §7Hint block number 3 (fill all slots with input hatches)\n   §fDynamo Hatch: §7Hint block number 4\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
